  "content": "<style>\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    color: black;\n    text-align: justify;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n}\n\n.title {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 35px;\n    line-height: 39px;\n    text-align: left;\n    width: 80%;\n    margin: 2em auto;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.h2 {\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.h3 {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5em;\n}\n\n.p {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.bold {\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.section {\n    margin-top: 30px;    \n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.responsive-img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    max-height: 450px;\n    display: block;\n    margin: auto;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.container {\n    width: 80%;\n    margin: auto;\n}\n\n.content-section {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.content-section .text-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-right: 5%;\n}\n\n.content-section .image-content {\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.content-section img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    max-height: 320px;\n}\n.mobile-img {\n    display: none;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 768px) { /* this is for screens smaller than 768px wide */\n    .content-section {\n        flex-direction: column-reverse;\n    }\n    .responsive-img {\n        display: none;\n    }\n    .mobile-img {\n        display: block;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n<style>\n/*(style remains unchanged, reusing your existing code)*/\n</style>\n<div class=\"container\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230621/eea541cd9bcffa269117ad4153896caa.png\" class=\"responsive-img\" /> <img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230621/68051b06c157342d0588fe5e25e5a5ab.jpg\" class=\"responsive-img mobile-img\" />\n<h2 class=\"h2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">MOMUTO isn't just about delivering top-notch, personalized football kits. It's about offering more&mdash;more value, more savings. We appreciate our customers and understand that fair pricing makes a difference. That's why we've launched an intuitive discount program, designed to reward you for your purchases, the more you buy, the more you save.</font></font></h2>\n<h2 class=\"h3\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">QUANTITY DISCOUNTS</font></font></h2>\n<p class=\"p\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Our discount program is a nod to the efficiency of bulk production. As your order quantity climbs, so do your savings. To embody this principle, we've designed our discount system. We've integrated a dynamic calculator tool on our product pages to keep things simple. Just tweak the order quantity and watch your savings increase immediately.</font></font></p>\n<h2 class=\"h3\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">SPECIAL PROMOTIONS</font></font></h2>\n<p class=\"p\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">For even more savings, keep an eye out for our special promotions! The best way to stay informed is to follow us on our social media platforms and subscribe to our newsletter. In addition to receiving updates on our promotions, subscribers will also get exclusive content, early access to new designs, and much more. Don't miss out on the chance to enhance your MOMUTO experience!</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><b><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Follow us on Social Media:</font></font></b> <a href=\"#\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Facebook</font></font></a><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> | </font></font><a href=\"#\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Twitter</font></font></a><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> | </font></font><a href=\"#\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Instagram</font></font></a></p>\n</div>",
